      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 69,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "对话是一个时刻，",
        "语境是一种持续的工作。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5c0cddb56c9c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 784,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 22,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 36.3,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "为什么留下原话，只是开始。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dc7ad7690f03",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.017",
      "kind": "text",
