    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 984,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 9.5,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 16,
      "letter_spacing": 2.4,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "关于",
        "连贯的一则手记。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-55008bbb8201",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 984,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "一次有用的对话，仍然可能很难重新接上。你记得某件事变清楚了，却不记得准确",
        "的说法、中途补充的约束，或到底在哪个窗口做了决定。对话确实发生过，连贯却",
        "没有自动到来。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82640dae68dd",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1111,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 想填补的，是这段空隙。它不在每次对话前要求你准备完美的简报，也不凌驾",
        "于你的表达之上，替你决定你是谁。它在原话旁边，提供一个工作空间：找回曾经",
        "的表达，看清来源，再决定它是否适合下一步。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d71c0c3a88e5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1238,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "保存一切，不等于善用某一部分。长期档案里可能有已经不再困扰你的问题、你从",
        "未认同的引文，以及被主动放弃的计划。把它们全部带进新任务，反而可能淹没你",
        "真正想找回的语境。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-cab99ed91bab",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.023",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x1": 287,
      "y1": 1385,
      "x2": 367,
      "y2": 1385,
      "stroke": "#a0a99e",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1427,
      "width": 701,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 43,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 51,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "真正有用的，",
        "可能是三句话，而不是三年。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-82a5cd584e11",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1603,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "选择很重要，修改的能力也同样重要。你可能希望原始记录保持完整，同时让今天",
        "的工作说明更短、更清楚。只要来源和工作版本不冒充彼此，这两种需要就并不矛",
        "盾。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9e2ffaaec9e4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.026",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1730,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "在这样的理解里，上下文不是系统暗中积累的个人画像，而是你可以查看，并有意",
        "带到某个具体问题里的材料。真正有用的可能是三句话，而不是三年的记录；真正",
        "相关的可能是你今天早上修改过的版本。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-3c938990e79a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 1857,
      "width": 690,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 32,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#37433b",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 从你已经在 AI 对话中产生的表达开始。它希望带来不依赖维护习惯的连贯：",
        "少一点重建，多一点继续。留下、回看、理解、复用，不是一条必须走完的流程，",
        "而是在过去的思考再次有用时，让它可以被找到。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-8c7dae4329fb",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "article-context-zh-1440.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 287,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 740,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 11,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 18.15,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "这是产品观点，不代表相关能力均已发布。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-02dda9d1f87c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
